What I Built
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I built &lt;a href="https://www.signalcend.com" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;SignalCend&lt;/a&gt; because I kept &lt;br&gt;
hitting these same patterns and kept watching them get misdiagnosed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It is a single API endpoint. POST your device state event. Get back &lt;br&gt;
one authoritative answer with a confidence score, recommended action &lt;br&gt;
enum, and full arbitration trace. 47ms average response time.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

